div.p:
The President of the German Reich, the President of the French Republic, His
                    Majesty the King of Great Britain, Ireland and the British Dominions beyond the
                    Seas, Emperor of India, and His Majesty the King of Italy;

Convinced that the state of disquiet which obtains throughout the world can only
                    be dissipated by reinforcing their solidarity in such a way as to strengthen
                    confidence in peace in Europe;
